.TH LEWITT-CONTROL-CENTER 1 "October 2026" "lewitt-connect2-unofficial 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
lewitt-control-center \- unofficial, experimental control application for the LEWITT CONNECT 2
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B lewitt-control-center
.RB [ \-\-mock "] [" \-\-show " page] [" \-\-screenshot " file] [" \-\-size " WxH] [" \-\-version ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A Qt 6 / QML control application. It is not affiliated with LEWITT. The control protocol was
derived by static analysis and has \fBnot been validated on real hardware\fR; writes to real
hardware are disabled, so a connected device is shown read-only. A simulated device is
included and always labelled as simulated.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-mock
Start with the simulated device.
.TP
.BI \-\-show " page"
Open settings, wizard or onboarding at start.
.TP
.BI \-\-screenshot " file"
Render one frame to a PNG and exit (offscreen use).
.TP
.BI \-\-size " WxH"
Window size for screenshots.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR lewitt-cli (1)
